        },
        {
          "text": " wakafika watu kadhaa toka Shekemu, na toka Shilo, na toka Samaria, watu themanini, nao wamenyoa ndevu zao, na kurarua nguo zao, nao wamejikatakata, wakichukua sadaka na ubani mikononi mwao, ili wazilete nyumbani kwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, akatoka Mizpa kwenda kuwalaki, akilia alipokuwa akiendelea; ikawa alipokutana nao akawaambia, Njooni kwa Gedalia, mwana wa Ahikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi ikawa walipokuwa katikati ya mji, Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, akawaua, akawatupa katika shimo, yeye na watu wale waliokuwa pamoja naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini watu kumi walionekana miongoni mwao, waliomwambia Ishmaeli, Usituue; kwa maana tuna akiba zetu zilizofichwa shambani, za ngano, na shayiri, na mafuta, na asali. Basi, akawaacha, asiwaue watu hao pamoja na ndugu zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.16+JOS.10.17+JOS.10.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 10:16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi, shimo lile, ambalo Ishmaeli amezitupa maiti za watu aliowaua, karibu na Gedalia, (ni lile lile alilolichimba Asa, mfalme, kwa kuwa alimwogopa Baasha, mfalme wa Israeli), Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, akalijaza kwa watu wale aliowaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
