            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini Yohana, mwana wa Karea, na makamanda wote wa majeshi waliokuwa pamoja naye, waliposikia habari za hayo mabaya yote aliyoyatenda Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wakawatwaa watu wote, wakaenda ili kupigana na Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, nao wakampata karibu na maji makuu ya Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, ikawa, watu wote waliokuwa pamoja na Ishmaeli, walipomwona Yohana, mwana wa Karea, na hao makamanda wote wa majeshi waliokuwa pamoja naye, ndipo wakafurahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, watu wote, ambao Ishmaeli amewachukua mateka kutoka Mizpa, wakazunguka, wakarudi, wakamwendea Yohana, mwana wa Karea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.30.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 30:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.20.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Fal 20:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini Ishmaeli, mwana wa Nethania, akatoroka pamoja na watu wanane, Yohana asimpate, akawaendea wana wa Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
